{"data": [{"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2118283626660212736"]}, "author_id": "14772995", "created_at": "2026-11-05T10:05:48.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118283633828204848"], "id": "2118283633828204848", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 219, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Lately I've seen a lot of people hitting their Grok bot limits, so here's the AI workflow I actually use day to day.\n\nShort version: almost every task goes through Grok bot, split into separate bots by role. Grok bot sorts the task itself, then decides whether to do it or hand it https://t.co/LHzUZEaFMa", "url": "https://x.com/seree/status/2118283633828204848"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2118270953901940736"]}, "author_id": "1166444989791948800", "created_at": "2026-11-05T09:15:28.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118270964769370195"], "id": "2118270964769370195", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 242, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "🤖 The Battle of Always-On AI Agents: Claude Duet vs. Grok Bot vs. ChatGPT Dots vs. Meta Muse\n\nA quick breakdown of next-generation, autonomous AI agents—each built on dedicated cloud environments to handle complex, ongoing tasks in the background:\n\n🎯 Which AI Agent is Best for https://t.co/znSQ345WVP", "url": "https://x.com/sustainme_in/status/2118270964769370195"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2118162719383638018", "3_2118162719400501248", "3_2118162719434039297", "3_2118162719408848896"]}, "author_id": "1523353770285219840", "created_at": "2026-11-05T02:07:28.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118163257957482925"], "id": "2118163257957482925", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 157, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "ArcaneMatrix · AI Brief 11/5\n\nHeadlines\n• OpenAI released Images 2.6 with animated GIF support and 50 percent faster generation.\n• Tencent Hunyuan released the official Hy4 model in full.\n• Reports say OpenAI executive Tibo took over an internal security project.\n• Cat Wu https://t.co/OVBuckcf0Q", "url": "https://x.com/arcanematrix/status/2118163257957482925"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2118029023657779200"]}, "author_id": "3146293339", "created_at": "2026-11-04T17:14:05.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118029026941899075"], "id": "2118029026941899075", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 161, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Today in Grok Bot news 🤖\n\nEight people who shared what they built, saved or learned with @bot in the last 24 hours:\n\n1. Fluixo: set up 2 Grok Bots + 2 Claude Code agents to run a content and lead workflow, going from $2,120/month and 180 hours to $47/month and 20 hours of https://t.co/wa9EjYufVo", "url": "https://x.com/AskTolik/status/2118029026941899075"}, {"article": {"title": "$20, $30 or $100: Which AI Employee to Hire — Grok Bot vs Claude Duet vs ChatGPT dots"}, "author_id": "1648201852263997440", "created_at": "2026-11-04T15:30:46.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118003024933142861"], "id": "2118003024933142861", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 23, "impression_count": 3675, "like_count": 27, "quote_count": 4, "reply_count": 18, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "One AI employee. Which do you hire?\n\nGrok Bot, $30: a team  that makes calls\nClaude Duet, $20: the careful one. You can't get in\nChatGPT dots, $100: won the only independent test\n\nI compared all three, the WIRED test and 25+ posts from daily users ↓ https://t.co/1FR2FIZVNm", "url": "https://x.com/molodoykiskaeb/status/2118003024933142861"}, {"author_id": "213059392", "created_at": "2026-11-04T15:04:10.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117996332224786810"], "id": "2117996332224786810", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 46, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "OpenAI Dots Pro excludes Switzerland.\n\nI live in Switzerland. I built an agent in Dots anyway. Via Business Premium.\n\nHis name is Kurt. He plans my day, checks my inbox, preps meetings and answers club questions.\n\nThe launch post said no. The plan details said yes.", "url": "https://x.com/DavideCundo/status/2117996332224786810"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2117980591308038144"]}, "author_id": "398680417", "created_at": "2026-11-04T14:01:38.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117980593275195408"], "id": "2117980593275195408", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 93, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Still collecting real Grok Bot use cases while I compare it with Meta Muse and ChatGPT Dots.\n\nThis batch: making videos. 4 from October.\n\nFirst: @anabology built a bot called Claudia that uses Suno, Midjourney and Opus. It made this music video teaser on its own. https://t.co/jAlE6yRjUU", "url": "https://x.com/leohuanfang/status/2117980593275195408"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2117910835205189632"]}, "author_id": "2060458803062276096", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:24:30.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117910852896461001"], "id": "2117910852896461001", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 56, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Another day of using ChatGPT Dots like a crazy boss &amp; another day of being in awe of this technology. \n\nIt just prepared my entire routine-Industry highlights and Content notion regime, which will prepare me for my day and for my content so i’m ahead of everyone else.\n\nJUST CRAZY https://t.co/BXNEf3hZho", "url": "https://x.com/aryamanupmanyuu/status/2117910852896461001"}, {"author_id": "1720665183188922368", "created_at": "2026-11-04T07:22:37.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117880177581502854"], "id": "2117880177581502854", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1399405236406702082", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 13, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117880024510730248", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@calebkipkirui_y Aggregate your private data (notes, emails, docs, code) into a searchable knowledge base. Spin up persistent agents via Grok Bots or OpenAI Dots, connect your tools, and give them standing goals plus long-term memory.\n\nExample 1: Research bot that continuously digests your domain", "url": "https://x.com/grok/status/2117880177581502854"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2117823650946744320", "3_2117824566609530880", "3_2117825122853896192"]}, "author_id": "1802887959840243712", "created_at": "2026-11-04T03:44:58.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117825405621330002"], "id": "2117825405621330002", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 111, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "[Three Personal Agents in 8 Weeks]\n\n📰 A roundup from Nov 3 put it plainly\n- Three personal agents launched within 8 weeks\n- Meta Muse came out Sep 8, and you can start free\n- OpenAI dots arrived Sep 29, centered on paid plans\n- Anthropic Claude Duet came Oct 21 as a research https://t.co/ExTpebkjVH", "url": "https://x.com/Semoritao0o/status/2117825405621330002"}, {"article": {"title": "Super-agent，是不是 Agent 的分水岭？"}, "author_id": "1912749962821267457", "created_at": "2026-11-04T03:00:27.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117814200169029983"], "id": "2117814200169029983", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 252, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "https://t.co/EX5GWdiG3b", "url": "https://x.com/XiaoFei88024/status/2117814200169029983"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2117766277003665408"]}, "author_id": "2071871914533068800", "created_at": "2026-11-03T23:50:50.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117766483178836208"], "id": "2117766483178836208", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 945, "like_count": 5, "quote_count": 2, "reply_count": 13, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Claude Duet 还在排队，GitHub 上已经有人做了免费开源版：6.7k 星，但它不是官方的，先看清能干什么\n建议收藏。读完你能判断：这个开源版值不值得现在就装，以及第一次打开该点哪几步。\n这是 GitHub 项目 Anil-matcha/open-duet 的 README（项目首页说明）写的，标题是《Open Duet》，不是 Anthropic https://t.co/fD7fFGCyX9", "url": "https://x.com/swordBluesy/status/2117766483178836208"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2117733174172176384"]}, "author_id": "837215679069700096", "created_at": "2026-11-03T21:38:30.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117733180320972946"], "id": "2117733180320972946", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 304, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114789222389297649", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Follow-up to my analysis of The @X Subscription, based on 40,618 @grok @bot usage records (Oct 13 – Nov 3, 2026).\n\nGrok Bot (@spacexai):\n• Premium: €30/mo → ~1.97B tokens/mo (€0.0158/1M)\n• Super: €100/mo → ~7.35B tokens/mo (€0.0139/1M)\n\nBoth include a persistent cloud https://t.co/87489lmIO9 https://t.co/aJlD6LKSEU", "url": "https://x.com/Rhiz3K/status/2117733180320972946"}, {"author_id": "2115720642230194176", "created_at": "2026-11-03T15:47:49.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117644928314757520"], "id": "2117644928314757520", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 10, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Personal AI agents in Europe, per makers' pages as of Nov 3:\n\nMeta Muse: not yet (US, Canada, Japan, Singapore)\nOpenAI dots: Business Premium yes, personal Pro not yet\nGrok Bot: yes, no family plan\nBipAgents: from the beta, Duo and Family up to 6, built on Hermes Agent", "url": "https://x.com/bipagents/status/2117644928314757520"}, {"article": {"title": "Three AI agents launched in six weeks. Who can use them, and who should wait"}, "author_id": "2114780102303023104", "created_at": "2026-11-03T14:56:55.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117632120776446443"], "id": "2117632120776446443", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 144, "like_count": 14, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 7, "retweet_count": 2}, "text": "https://t.co/MYE3wlAA7f", "url": "https://x.com/itsmeloox/status/2117632120776446443"}, {"author_id": "151076374", "created_at": "2026-11-02T18:40:15.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117325935582007775"], "id": "2117325935582007775", "in_reply_to_user_id": "2013994870893957121", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 89, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117005296702783903", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@husamujahed Browser puppeteering is the duct tape we all end up with 😄 My son built https://t.co/fRF3SGMciL for exactly this: Grok Bot and OpenAI dots are both on its supported list. One honest caveat: dots connect via quick connect, which isn't end-to-end encrypted. Free and open source.", "url": "https://x.com/zabrodsk/status/2117325935582007775"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2117258118325248001", "3_2117260015773888512"]}, "author_id": "125262594", "created_at": "2026-11-02T14:27:36.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117262353221685516"], "id": "2117262353221685516", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 50, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116036703538606301", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "New frontier models were being released quicker and quicker, with the crown changing hands often weekly. Then October came and went without one.\n\nAre the labs holding the models back for internal use? Or was September just an outlier?\n\nAnother reason could be that the race has https://t.co/ZBdo0v3hzR https://t.co/Qog9xwqdat", "url": "https://x.com/livioq/status/2117262353221685516"}, {"article": {"title": "i give chatgpt dots one job at a time. here's the coding walkthrough i reuse"}, "author_id": "1473214003027460098", "created_at": "2026-11-02T08:39:33.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117174762078363832"], "id": "2117174762078363832", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 526, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 2}, "text": "https://t.co/SBmcEWvwn1", "url": "https://x.com/prince_twets/status/2117174762078363832"}, {"author_id": "31813795", "created_at": "2026-11-02T06:44:37.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117145841488347386"], "id": "2117145841488347386", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 291, "like_count": 6, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "I built a shopping app called Sweetcouch. It reached 10 million users, was backed by Sequoia, and was named among the Best iPhone Shopping Apps of 2016.\n\nThen AI arrived, and honestly, we were clueless.\n\nHow do you put AI inside a consumer product? The easy answer is to bolt a", "url": "https://x.com/RajeshChokhani/status/2117145841488347386"}, {"author_id": "1889013392784216066", "created_at": "2026-11-02T06:03:31.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117135494639128847"], "id": "2117135494639128847", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1180382576", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 8, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117130835346571482", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@luismeta Nice move. Keeping the workflow intact makes way more sense than rebuilding everything from zero. How’s ChatGPT dots handling the agent side compared to Grok so far?", "url": "https://x.com/LeafMetaX/status/2117135494639128847"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2117118853159559168"]}, "author_id": "1180382576", "created_at": "2026-11-02T05:45:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117130835346571482"], "id": "2117130835346571482", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 3, "impression_count": 537, "like_count": 21, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 8, "retweet_count": 4}, "text": "I moved my Grok Bot workflow into ChatGPT dots. \n\nThe useful part was bringing the workflow with me, not starting over. https://t.co/k71eLiIW1u", "url": "https://x.com/luismeta/status/2117130835346571482"}, {"author_id": "1665335769538392064", "created_at": "2026-11-02T04:14:39.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117108099517476992"], "id": "2117108099517476992", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 195, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "𝗧𝗵𝗲 𝗢𝗽𝗲𝗻-𝗦𝗼𝘂𝗿𝗰𝗲 𝗔𝗻𝘀𝘄𝗲𝗿 𝘁𝗼 𝗖𝗹𝗮𝘂𝗱𝗲 𝗗𝘂𝗲𝘁 𝗮𝗻𝗱 𝗢𝗽𝗲𝗻𝗔𝗜 𝗗𝗼𝘁𝘀\n\nYou ask a chatbot for something. It answers. Then it stops and waits.\n\nBut real work doesn't fit in one question. A price you want to watch every day. A research job that takes half", "url": "https://x.com/Ldataengineer/status/2117108099517476992"}, {"article": {"title": "10 Million Users Embraced Personal Agents, Yet Real-World AI Orders Total Only a Few Hundred. Why?"}, "author_id": "870859162011394048", "created_at": "2026-11-02T02:41:33.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117084669074358777"], "id": "2117084669074358777", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1468, "like_count": 6, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 6, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "A Personal Agent is not merely the next-generation chatbox，Only the platform that continuously earns user authorization and trust will have a genuine shot at reshaping the primary gateway to the internet. https://t.co/c3DwVuvtfR", "url": "https://x.com/Mango_Wg/status/2117084669074358777"}, {"article": {"title": "GitHub Copilot Automationsが「成果から学ぶ」自動化に──支出上限・学習の承認・課金先から、事務所"}, "author_id": "1618421754602606592", "created_at": "2026-11-02T02:13:51.000Z", "edit_history_twe